<title>FRANCE: Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of December 17 in the July-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On December 19, the EU additionally granted exports of 397,500 tonnes of soft wheat, 258,961 tonnes of barley, 11,000 tonnes of rye and 13,300 tonnes of durum wheat.</p>
<p>Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
